"the variable is used afterwards to infer its type. Here's an advanced "
"example of type inference:"
msgstr "O tipo inference engine is pretty smart. It does more than looking at o tipo of o valor expression during um initialization. It also looks at how o variável is usado afterwards to infer its tipo. Here's um advanced example of tipo inference:"

#: src/types/inference.md:10
msgid ""
"// Because of the annotation, the compiler knows that `elem` has type u8.\n"
msgstr ""
