"    // just knows that it's a vector of something (`Vec<_>`).\n"
msgstr ""
"// At este point o compiler doesn't know o exact tipo of `vec`, it\n"
"    // just knows aquele it's um vector of something (`Vec<_>`).\n"

#: src/types/inference.md:18
msgid "// Insert `elem` in the vector.\n"
msgstr ""
"// Insert `elem` in o vector.\n"

#: src/types/inference.md:20
