msgid ""
"Similar to [`From` and `Into`](from_into.html), [`TryFrom`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/std/convert/trait.TryFrom.html) and [`TryInto`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/std/convert/trait.TryInto.html) are generic traits for converting "
"between types. Unlike `From`/`Into`, the `TryFrom`/`TryInto` traits are used "
"for fallible conversions, and as such, return [`Result`](https://doc.rust-"
"lang.org/std/result/enum.Result.html)s."
msgstr "Similar to [`From` and `Into`](from_into.html), [`TryFrom`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/convert/trait.TryFrom.html) e [`TryInto`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/convert/trait.TryInto.html) are generic traits para converting between tipos. Unlike `From`/`Into`, o `TryFrom`/`TryInto` traits are usado para fallible conversions, e as such, retorna [`Result`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/result/enum.Result.html)s."

