"// What if you don't start with a reference? `reference` was a `&`\n"
"    // because the right side was already a reference. This is not\n"
"    // a reference because the right side is not one.\n"
msgstr ""
"// What if you don't start com um reference? `reference` was um `&`\n"
"    // porque o right side was already um reference. Este is not\n"
"    // um reference porque o right side is not one.\n"

