"// On the other hand, the \"continue\" expression does not return\n"
"                // u32, but it is still fine, because it never returns and "
"therefore\n"
"                // does not violate the type requirements of the match "
"expression.\n"
msgstr ""
"// On o other hand, o \"continue\" expression does not retorna\n"
"                // u32, but it is still fine, porque it never retorna e therefore\n"
"                // does not violate o tipo requirements of o match expression.\n"

