#: src/error/option_unwrap/map.md:3
msgid ""
"`match` is a valid method for handling `Option`s. However, you may "
"eventually find heavy usage tedious, especially with operations only valid "
"with an input. In these cases, [combinators](https://doc.rust-lang.org/"
"reference/glossary.html#combinator) can be used to manage control flow in a "
"modular fashion."
msgstr "`match` is um válido método para handling `Option`s. However, you may eventually find heavy usage tedious, especially com operations only válido com um entrada. In estes cases, [combinators](https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/glossary.html#combinator) pode be usado to manage control flow in um modular fashion."

