"Like `Option`, `Result` has many methods associated with it. `unwrap()`, for "
"example, either yields the element `T` or `panic`s. For case handling, there "
"are many combinators between `Result` and `Option` that overlap."
msgstr "Like `Option`, `Result` has many métodos associated com it. `unwrap()`, para example, either yields o element `T` ou `panic`s. Para case handling, there are many combinators between `Result` e `Option` aquele overlap."

