msgstr "UM way to write simple code while preserving o original erros is to [`Box`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/boxed/struct.Box.html) them.  O drawback is aquele o underlying erro tipo is only known at runtime e not [statically determined](https://doc.rust-lang.org/book/ch17-02-trait-objects.html#trait-objects-perform-dynamic-dispatch)."

