"stack. While unwinding, the runtime will take care of freeing all the "
"resources _owned_ by the thread by calling the destructor of all its objects."
msgstr "O `panic!` macro pode be usado to generate um panic e start unwinding its stack. While unwinding, o runtime vai take care of freeing all o resources _owned_ by o thread by calling o destructor of all its objects."

#: src/std/panic.md:7
