#: src/std/arc.md:3
msgid ""
"When shared ownership between threads is needed, `Arc`(Atomically Reference "
"Counted) can be used. This struct, via the `Clone` implementation can create "
"a reference pointer for the location of a value in the memory heap while "
"increasing the reference counter. As it shares ownership between threads, "
"when the last reference pointer to a value is out of scope, the variable is "
"dropped."
msgstr "When shared ownership between threads is needed, `Arc`(Atomically Reference Counted) pode be usado. Este struct, via o `Clone` implementation pode create um reference pointer para o location of um valor in o memory heap while increasing o reference counter. As it shares ownership between threads, when o último reference pointer to um valor is out of scope, o variável is dropped."

